  "visualAssessment": [
    "The rounder scalp-constrained crown is preserved. The left near-apex span is 83 columns for r0507 B, 67 for r0509 B, and 59 for each r0510 candidate in the 720 px front views.",
    "A removes some short-scale waviness and softens the lifted edge slightly. The sudden dark break remains visible at the ear-side corner.",
    "B carries the visible hairline into the temple more gradually. The side and held-turn captures show a shallower overhang and a cleaner outline near the exposed ear. The crown and the long glossy side groups still read as synthetic, and the remaining right-side rear junction needs shaping.",
    "The matched whole figure does not establish a finished woman. B is the local hairstyle research candidate, contingent on the selected held skin tests."
  ],
  "categoryReview": {
